ld capture Black's knight on g3! This wins a piece outright.\n\nReason: Capturing the knight with f2-g3 wins material cleanly. Combined with my existing advantage (two rooks and bishop vs rook), this should lead to an easy win. Removing the knight also eliminates the immediate tactical threats around my king.\n\nAnswer: P: f2-g3"}
