 and prepares to support my passed e-pawn or attack Black's pawns.\n\nReason: R: f6-f8 is the strongest move because:\n- It seizes control of the critical 8th rank\n- Severely restricts Black king's movement\n- Prepares to support the e5 pawn's advance\n- Maintains maximum pressure with superior material\n- The Black rook on b1 cannot effectively counter this plan\n\nAnswer: R: f6-f8"}
