ng would be trapped on the back rank with very limited options.\n\nReason: R: b7-a7 is the strongest move because it:\n- Cuts off the Black King's escape to a7\n- Dominates the 7th rank\n- Creates immediate mating threats when combined with my other pieces\n- Forces Black into a defensive position with limited counterplay\n- The Black King on a8 becomes increasingly trapped\n\nAnswer: R: b7-a7"}
