en vs opponent's remaining pieces). With a Queen, I can:\n- Dominate the board\n- Create multiple threats\n- Force Black's king into submission\n- Easily coordinate with my other pieces for checkmate\n\nThere's no reason to delay this promotion or choose any other piece (Knight, Bishop, or Rook would all be inferior to a Queen in this position).\n\nAnswer: P: e7-e8-q"}
