 h4 pawn with g3-h4 accomplishes multiple objectives:\n- Eliminates Black's most advanced and dangerous pawn\n- Increases my material advantage (4 pawns + Bishop vs 2 pawns)\n- Removes an immediate threat\n- Gives me better winning chances with superior material\n\nThis is a concrete gain that simplifies the position in my favor.\n\nAnswer: P: g3-h4"}
