.\n\nReason:\nAdvancing c4-c5 creates an unstoppable passed pawn that the Black King cannot catch in time. This forces Black into a losing race where I can either promote the pawn or use it as a decoy while advancing my other pawns. This is the most forcing and direct path to victory.\n\nAnswer: P: c4-c5"}
